  "createdAt": "2026-10-15T03:41:41.340041Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-15T03:44:05.059705Z",
  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22a8fc72e2b18b57",
      "translationZh": "我们非常高兴地宣布，Baseten 现已成为 Hugging Face Hub 支持的推理服务提供商！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3d80739f059aaad",
      "translationZh": "Baseten 加入了我们不断壮大的生态系统，进一步丰富并增强了直接在 Hub 模型页面上使用的无服务器推理服务。推理服务提供商也已无缝集成到我们的客户端 SDK（支持 JS 和 Python）中，让你能够轻松通过自己偏好的服务提供商使用各种模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67dc464894ef4912",
      "translationZh": "Baseten 是一个 AI 基础设施平台，涵盖无服务器 AI、训练等领域。Baseten 提供众多前沿模型，让开发者只需极少的配置，就能轻松将广泛的 AI 能力集成到自己的应用中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "531cc6f7d6ffd2ab",
      "translationZh": "Baseten 支持广泛的模型类型，从 LLM 到文本转语音等。作为此次初步集成的一部分，Baseten 开始在 Hugging Face 上支持对话和文本生成任务，让用户能够访问 Kimi K3、最新的 DeepSeek V4 Flash、GLM-5.2 等热门开放权重 LLM。对更多任务的支持也将很快推出！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1f15651cf854bf8",
      "translationZh": "在此查看 Baseten 支持的完整模型列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93d9466853923da4",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face 上关注 Baseten：https://huggingface.co/baseten。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81081802da8646bb",
      "translationZh": "在网站用户界面中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71d763e2913402e9",
      "translationZh": "在用户账户设置中，你可以：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "765e68be70be4304",
      "translationZh": "为你已注册的服务提供商设置自己的 API 密钥。如果未设置自定义密钥，你的请求将通过 HF 路由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d74cb8ea19d4fc72",
      "translationZh": "按偏好对服务提供商排序。这一排序适用于模型页面中的小组件和代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10dba80cb700cfe7",
      "translationZh": "如前所述，调用 Inference Providers 时有两种模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70ad596a5abeea36",
      "translationZh": "自定义密钥（使用你在相应推理服务提供商处的 API 密钥，直接向该推理服务提供商发起调用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43848c3df5d9232d",
      "translationZh": "由 HF 路由（在这种情况下，你不需要服务提供商的令牌，费用会直接计入你的 HF 账户，而非你在服务提供商处的账户）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7ae8780922d4fe1",
      "translationZh": "模型页面会展示第三方推理服务提供商（与当前模型兼容，并按用户偏好排序）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be0d888d38854a72",
      "translationZh": "通过客户端 SDK",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbbfadb556ad894b",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过 Hugging Face SDK 使用 Baseten：Python 使用 huggingface_hub (>= 1.26.1)，JavaScript 使用 @huggingface/inference。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79d694439d14f7fc",
      "translationZh": "以下示例展示了如何通过 Baseten 使用最新的 DeepSeek V4 Flash。使用 Hugging Face 令牌进行身份验证，请求将自动路由至 Baseten。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb35a06a795cfcd4",
      "translationZh": "通过你喜爱的智能体运行框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c4042b5d8e91a84",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Inference Providers 已集成到大多数智能体运行框架中，包括 Pi、OpenCode、Hermes Agents、OpenClaw 等。这意味着你可以将 baseten 托管的模型直接接入你喜爱的工具，无需任何额外的胶水代码。在此浏览完整的集成列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1ff64d1c81398ab1",
      "translationZh": "通过 Python",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7e4ab8ec415ead90",
      "translationZh": "通过 JS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ac8bbca9a74cfbd",
      "translationZh": "计费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75cfa1d5ac2a1a4d",
      "translationZh": "对于直接请求，即使用推理提供商密钥发出的请求，由相应的提供商向你计费。例如，如果你使用 baseten API 密钥，费用将计入你的 baseten 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6101607d5536134f",
      "translationZh": "对于经路由转发的请求，也就是通过 Hugging Face Hub 进行身份验证的请求，你只需支付提供商的标准 API 费率。我们不会额外加价；我们只是直接按提供商的费用收费。（未来，我们可能会与提供商合作伙伴达成收入分成协议。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267e8c36449a9380",
      "translationZh": "重要提示 ‼️ PRO 用户每月可获得价值 $2 的推理额度。你可以跨提供商使用这些额度。🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e2ea1d08ca3f42b",
      "translationZh": "订阅 Hugging Face PRO 计划，即可获得推理额度、ZeroGPU、Spaces Dev Mode、20 倍的使用限额等更多权益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f78dc149c1ec0490",
      "translationZh": "我们也为已登录的免费用户提供少量免费推理额度，但如果条件允许，请升级到 PRO！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c625dbaf508de2f3",
      "translationZh": "反馈与后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf060e0cea2edb62",
      "translationZh": "我们非常期待收到你的反馈！欢迎在这里分享你的想法和/或评论：https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface/HuggingDiscussions/discussions/49",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
